{"id":"u113","kelas":"kosa","no":14,"judul":"Rangkuman Kosakata dan Menulis","title":"Vocabulary and Writing Review","emoji":"🎓","ringkas":"Latihan campuran semua materi kosakata dan menulis","ready":true,"goals":["mengulang **kata tertukar, awalan, akhiran, dan kosakata tema**","mengulang **tanda baca, paragraf, dan email**","mengerjakan latihan **campuran** dari semua unit kosakata dan menulis","menemukan bagian yang perlu diulang"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Unit ini mengulang seluruh level Kosakata dan Menulis. Kerjakan latihan dan kuis, lalu ulangi unit yang masih sulit."},{"t":"grammar","title":"Peta ringkas","table":[["Unit","Isi utama","Contoh"],["100–101 Kata tertukar","its/it's, there/their, make/do, affect/effect","[[its]] – [[it's]], [[make]] – [[do]]"],["102–103 Pembentukan kata","awalan dan akhiran","[[unhappy]], [[teacher]], [[careful]]"],["104–109 Kosakata tema","rumah, tubuh, pakaian, kota, pekerjaan, hobi","[[kitchen]], [[fever]], [[size]], [[station]], [[mechanic]], [[chess]]"],["110 Tanda baca","kapital, koma, apostrof","[[Rani's bag]], [[However,]]"],["111 Paragraf","topik, pendukung, penutup","[[First]], [[That is why]]"],["112 Email","salam, isi, penutup","[[Dear Mr. Adi,]], [[Yours sincerely]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Rutinitas mingguan","text":"Pilih satu tema kosakata per minggu, tulis satu paragraf pendek tentangnya, lalu kirim email kepada dirimu sendiri memakai kata baru."},{"t":"summary","items":["Kata tertukar: pelajari berpasangan.","Awalan dan akhiran memperbanyak kosakata.","Kosakata tema + pola kalimat.","Tanda baca, paragraf, dan email."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"___ a beautiful day.\"","options":["It's","Its","Is","It"],"answer":0,"exp":"It is → It's.","k":"3eaa8d87"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar:","options":["It's too late to go there.","Its too late to go their.","It's to late to go there.","Its two late too go there."],"answer":0,"exp":"It is + too + there.","k":"14779e26"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia lebih tinggi daripada aku.","q":"She is taller ___ me.","answers":["than"],"hint":"t _ _ _","exp":"Perbandingan → than.","k":"acbb3dbc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka teman-temanku.","q":"___ my friends.","answers":["They're","Theyre"],"hint":"T _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"They are → They're.","k":"a59f6e37"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sup ini terlalu asin.","q":"This soup is ___ salty.","answers":["too"],"hint":"t _ _","exp":"Terlalu → too.","k":"42d46aa2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"I bought ___ books.\"","options":["two","to","too","tow"],"answer":0,"exp":"Angka 2 → two.","k":"034aa988"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"Is this ___ pen?\"","options":["your","you're","you","yours pen"],"answer":0,"exp":"Milikmu → your.","k":"0c47dbe5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"She ___ a cake for my birthday.\"","options":["made","did","maked","done"],"answer":0,"exp":"Cake → make. Kalimat lengkap: **She made a cake for my birthday.**","k":"8106a6a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"Can you ___ me a favour?\"","options":["do","make","give","have"],"answer":0,"exp":"Do a favour. Kalimat lengkap: **Can you do me a favour?**","k":"e31caa58"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"The ___ of the medicine was fast.\"","options":["effect","affect","affected","affects"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata benda → effect.","k":"5bc2b84c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jangan kehilangan kuncimu.","q":"Don't ___ your keys.","answers":["lose"],"hint":"l _ _ _","exp":"Lose = kehilangan.","k":"958afc0f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah aku meminjam pulpenmu?","q":"Can I ___ your pen?","answers":["borrow"],"hint":"b _ _ _ _ _","exp":"Borrow = meminjam.","k":"1dddaacb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"We ___ about the film for an hour.\"","options":["talked","said","told","speaked"],"answer":0,"exp":"Talk about. Kalimat lengkap: **We talked about the film for an hour.**","k":"bd5185d8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"These trousers are too ___.\"","options":["loose","lose","lost","loosen"],"answer":0,"exp":"Longgar → loose.","k":"457f2c1c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih awalan yang tepat untuk \"pratinjau\": ___view","options":["pre","un","dis","mis"],"answer":0,"exp":"preview = pratinjau.","k":"3e3e4b54"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"misunderstand\" adalah...","options":["salah paham","sangat paham","paham lagi","tidak ada arti"],"answer":0,"exp":"Mis- = salah.","k":"8537e76e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih awalan yang tepat untuk \"bekerja terlalu keras\": ___work","options":["over","re","dis","mis"],"answer":0,"exp":"overwork = bekerja terlalu keras.","k":"6bab8bee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"unhappy\" adalah...","options":["tidak bahagia","sangat bahagia","bahagia lagi","sebelum bahagia"],"answer":0,"exp":"Un- = tidak. Jawaban yang tepat: **tidak bahagia**.","k":"1ed7c23c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih awalan yang tepat untuk \"tidak sah / melanggar hukum\": ___legal","options":["il","un","dis","mis"],"answer":0,"exp":"illegal = tidak sah / melanggar hukum.","k":"e4a62546"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"overcook\" adalah...","options":["memasak terlalu lama","memasak kurang matang","memasak ulang","tidak memasak"],"answer":0,"exp":"Over- = terlalu.","k":"17d538e1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih awalan yang tepat untuk \"meremehkan\": ___estimate","options":["under","re","dis","mis"],"answer":0,"exp":"underestimate = meremehkan.","k":"92006098"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih bentuk kata yang tepat: \"He is a famous ___.\" (Dia aktor terkenal.)","options":["actor","active","acting","action"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata dasar act → actor.","k":"e0ad67e8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jenis kata \"slowly\" adalah...","options":["kata keterangan","kata sifat","kata benda","kata kerja"],"answer":0,"exp":"-ly = adverb.","k":"48488408"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih bentuk kata yang tepat: \"They want to ___ the road.\" (Mereka ingin melebarkan jalan.)","options":["widen","width","widely","wider"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata dasar wide → widen.","k":"59476230"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih bentuk kata yang tepat: \"He was ___ and forgot his keys.\" (Dia ceroboh dan lupa kuncinya.)","options":["careless","careful","caring","carefully"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata dasar care → careless.","k":"5dae61b8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berhati-hatilah.","q":"Be ___.","answers":["careful"],"hint":"c _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"Care + ful. Jawaban yang tepat: **careful**.","k":"906a1bf4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih bentuk kata yang tepat: \"The holiday was very ___.\" (Liburannya sangat menyenangkan.)","options":["enjoyable","enjoying","enjoyment","enjoyed by"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata dasar enjoy → enjoyable.","k":"c2250418"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih bentuk kata yang tepat: \"She is a ___ singer.\" (Dia penyanyi terkenal.)","options":["famous","famously","famed by","fames"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata dasar fame → famous.","k":"44a50af1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["On Friday we eat fish rice, and soup.","On Friday, we eat fish, rice, and soup.","We eat fish, rice, and soup.","On Friday we eat soup."],"answer":0,"exp":"Daftar perlu koma yang rapi.","k":"b933b1da"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar:","options":["She said, \"I am ready.\"","She said \"I am ready.","She said, I am ready.\"","She said I am \"ready.\""],"answer":0,"exp":"Tanda kutip membuka dan menutup ucapan.","k":"a8088144"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar:","options":["What a beautiful day!","What a beautiful day.","What a beautiful day?","What a beautiful day,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Seruan → ! Jawaban yang tepat: **What a beautiful day!**","k":"573e3de4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar:","options":["However, it was too late.","However it was too late.","However; it was too late.","However. it was too late."],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata pembuka + koma.","k":"71cf2ae2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar (buku milik banyak siswa):","options":["The students' books are on the desk.","The student's books are on the desk.","The students books are on the desk.","The students's books are on the desk."],"answer":0,"exp":"Milik jamak → s'.","k":"983ac999"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Fungsi apostrof pada \"Rani's bag\" adalah...","options":["kepemilikan","singkatan","jamak","pertanyaan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Milik Rani. Jawaban yang tepat: **kepemilikan**.","k":"248e4905"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar:","options":["I bought apples, oranges, and bananas.","I bought apples oranges and bananas.","I bought, apples oranges, and bananas.","I bought apples, oranges and, bananas."],"answer":0,"exp":"Daftar dipisah koma.","k":"aa214336"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat topik terbaik untuk paragraf tentang hobi membaca?","options":["Reading is my favourite hobby.","I have a book at the moment.","Books are on the shelf this week.","Yesterday I went to school."],"answer":0,"exp":"Kalimat topik menyatakan gagasan utama.","k":"bec3f282"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat topik terbaik untuk paragraf tentang sekolahku?","options":["My school is a friendly place.","It has desks these days.","The bell rings.","I walk to school as usual."],"answer":0,"exp":"Kalimat topik menyatakan gagasan utama.","k":"682a0a5e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa fungsi \"for example\"?","options":["memberi contoh","menutup paragraf","menyatakan alasan","menyatakan perlawanan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Contoh. Jawaban yang tepat: **memberi contoh**.","k":"267a0c82"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata penghubung yang tepat: \"___, I wake up. Then I take a shower.\"","options":["First","Because","However","Such as"],"answer":0,"exp":"Memulai urutan.","k":"6170d184"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pada paragraf yang sama, kata \"Then\" berfungsi untuk...","options":["menunjukkan urutan","memberi contoh","menyatakan lawan","menyatakan alasan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Then = lalu. Jawaban yang tepat: **menunjukkan urutan**.","k":"f0d1bfd6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata penghubung yang tepat: \"___, she goes to bed at ten.\" (terakhir)","options":["Finally","First","Because","However"],"answer":0,"exp":"Menutup urutan.","k":"b344f251"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang tidak sesuai? \"Fruit is healthy. Apples have vitamins. I like blue shirts. Oranges help our bodies.\"","options":["I like blue shirts.","Fruit is healthy.","Apples have vitamins.","Oranges help our bodies."],"answer":0,"exp":"Tidak berhubungan dengan buah.","k":"7102d188"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Salam yang cocok untuk email ke seorang kepala sekolah bernama Mr. Adi:","options":["Dear Mr. Adi,","Hey dude,","Yo Adi,","What's up Adi,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Resmi. Jawaban yang tepat: **Dear Mr. Adi,**.","k":"2adc6b71"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas emailmu.","q":"Thank you ___ your email.","answers":["for"],"hint":"f _ _","exp":"Thank you for.","k":"3d76bef1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penutup yang cocok untuk teman dekat:","options":["See you soon!","Yours faithfully,","Respectfully yours,","With regards to,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Santai. Jawaban yang tepat: **See you soon!**","k":"a700aa13"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku menulis untuk menanyakan kursus.","q":"I am writing ___ ask about the course.","answers":["to"],"hint":"t _","exp":"I am writing to + V1.","k":"cb0e38b7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang terlalu kaku untuk email kepada sahabat?","options":["I hereby inform you that I shall attend.","Hi Rani, I can come!","See you soon!","How is your week?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terlalu kaku.","k":"7c37f323"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Salam yang cocok jika nama penerima tidak diketahui:","options":["Dear Sir or Madam,","Hi mate,","Dear Rani,","Hey you,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Resmi tanpa nama.","k":"289cdfba"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Urutan bagian email yang benar:","options":["subjek, salam, isi, penutup, nama","isi, salam, nama, subjek, penutup","penutup, isi, salam, subjek, nama","nama, subjek, isi, salam, penutup"],"answer":0,"exp":"Urutan baku. Jawaban yang tepat: **subjek, salam, isi, penutup, nama**.","k":"8ffc8fb9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"kulkas\" adalah...","options":["fridge","broom","stove","towel"],"answer":0,"exp":"kulkas = fridge.","k":"2e76f8db"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"broom\"?","options":["sapu","cermin","handuk","atap"],"answer":0,"exp":"broom = sapu.","k":"167c7c1b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"washing machine\"?","options":["mesin cuci","oven","kamar mandi","kipas angin"],"answer":0,"exp":"washing machine = mesin cuci.","k":"90bfba46"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"washing machine","options":["washing machine","bathroom","fridge","garage"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: washing machine.","k":"8f412a9c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"fridge","options":["fridge","kitchen","lamp","curtain"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: fridge.","k":"1e268d62"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"punggung\" adalah...","options":["back","nurse","pill","rest"],"answer":0,"exp":"punggung = back.","k":"faedbc87"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"fever\"?","options":["demam","lutut","obat","dokter"],"answer":0,"exp":"fever = demam.","k":"bc2a30fd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"nurse\"?","options":["perawat","siku","gigi","bahu"],"answer":0,"exp":"nurse = perawat.","k":"8719e5d8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"pil / tablet\" adalah...","options":["pill","tired","appointment","doctor"],"answer":0,"exp":"pil / tablet = pill.","k":"d7bba004"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"back","options":["back","cold","tooth","sore"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: back.","k":"c4c1aebe"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"kecil\" adalah...","options":["small","shoes","tight","cashier"],"answer":0,"exp":"kecil = small.","k":"d65b9dca"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"dress\"?","options":["gaun","sepatu","kecil","longgar"],"answer":0,"exp":"dress = gaun.","k":"0f04d4c8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"celana panjang\" adalah...","options":["trousers","hat","price","loose"],"answer":0,"exp":"celana panjang = trousers.","k":"4156c8dd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"sale\"?","options":["obral","mahal","sepatu","kecil"],"answer":0,"exp":"sale = obral.","k":"cde974dc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"murah\" adalah...","options":["cheap","trousers","tight","receipt"],"answer":0,"exp":"murah = cheap.","k":"b2c5a0e8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"journey\"?","options":["perjalanan","sepeda","sudut jalan","jadwal"],"answer":0,"exp":"journey = perjalanan.","k":"79d0ac49"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"bicycle","options":["bicycle","train","motorbike","platform"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: bicycle.","k":"fc44ffb0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"delay\"?","options":["keterlambatan","bandara","jembatan","sepeda motor"],"answer":0,"exp":"delay = keterlambatan.","k":"2d9aa338"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"pengemudi\" adalah...","options":["driver","crossing","truck","airport"],"answer":0,"exp":"pengemudi = driver.","k":"0f54a535"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"truk\" adalah...","options":["truck","corner","bridge","train"],"answer":0,"exp":"truk = truck.","k":"b85a486c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"pelayan\" adalah...","options":["waiter","manage","cook","farm"],"answer":0,"exp":"pelayan = waiter.","k":"329418a2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"school\"?","options":["sekolah","kantor","mengantar","memperbaiki"],"answer":0,"exp":"school = sekolah.","k":"3254305c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"accountant\"?","options":["akuntan","menjual","kantor","pelayan"],"answer":0,"exp":"accountant = akuntan.","k":"278fec9a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"cook\"?","options":["juru masak","mengantar","bengkel","montir"],"answer":0,"exp":"cook = juru masak.","k":"e2867e65"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"design\"?","options":["merancang","perawat","juru masak","melayani"],"answer":0,"exp":"design = merancang.","k":"f9da1f65"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"swimming","options":["swimming","draw","song","actor"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: swimming.","k":"154f76ba"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"comedy","options":["comedy","badminton","cycling","actor"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: comedy.","k":"048265d5"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"badminton","options":["badminton","cycling","puzzle","gardening"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: badminton.","k":"f8fe49cf"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"bersepeda\" adalah...","options":["cycling","team","draw","football"],"answer":0,"exp":"bersepeda = cycling.","k":"f22c5783"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Kata mana yang kamu dengar?","say":"draw","options":["draw","puzzle","football","gardening"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata yang diucapkan: draw.","k":"13b5b7e7"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"It is impossible to unlock the unfair rule.","answer":"It is impossible to unlock the unfair rule.","exp":"Kalimatnya: It is impossible to unlock the unfair rule. Artinya: Mustahil membuka aturan yang tidak adil itu.","k":"4ff17b0e"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"Rani's mother is a busy nurse at a hospital.","answer":"Rani's mother is a busy nurse at a hospital.","exp":"Kalimatnya: Rani's mother is a busy nurse at a hospital. Artinya: Ibu Rani adalah perawat sibuk di rumah sakit.","k":"360aad96"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"When it rains, we stay at home and watch a film.","answer":"When it rains, we stay at home and watch a film.","exp":"Kalimatnya: When it rains, we stay at home and watch a film. Artinya: Kalau hujan, kami di rumah dan menonton film.","k":"3c522864"},{"type":"dictate","q":"Dengarkan, lalu ketik kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"Dear Mr. Adi, I am writing to ask about the course.","answer":"Dear Mr. Adi, I am writing to ask about the course.","exp":"Kalimatnya: Dear Mr. Adi, I am writing to ask about the course. Artinya: Yth. Pak Adi, saya menulis untuk menanyakan kursus.","k":"f0e2835c"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar:","options":["It's a shame its door is broken.","Its a shame it's door is broken.","It's a shame it's door is broken.","Its a shame its door is broken."],"answer":0,"exp":"It is a shame; milik benda → its.","k":"25724133"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"I like all fruit ___ durian.\"","options":["except","accept","expect","also"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kecuali → except.","k":"98247b92"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih awalan yang tepat untuk \"salah paham\": ___understand","options":["mis","un","dis","im"],"answer":0,"exp":"misunderstand = salah paham.","k":"3897fa19"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Akhiran -ment pada \"payment\" menunjukkan...","options":["kata benda","kata sifat","kata kerja","kata keterangan"],"answer":0,"exp":"-ment = noun.","k":"b98e4f71"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar:","options":["They're my friends.","Theyre my friends.","They'r my friends.","Th'ey're my friends."],"answer":0,"exp":"They are → They're.","k":"fd6e3b1f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata penghubung: \"___, I take a shower. Then I eat breakfast.\"","options":["First","However","Because","For example"],"answer":0,"exp":"Awal urutan. Kalimat lengkap: **First, I take a shower. Then I eat breakfast.**","k":"0c318700"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penutup yang cocok untuk teman:","options":["See you soon!","Yours faithfully,","Respectfully yours,","With regards,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Santai. Jawaban yang tepat: **See you soon!**","k":"1ca7b7ae"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti kata \"stairs\" adalah...","options":["tangga","kompor","ember","atap"],"answer":0,"exp":"stairs = tangga.","k":"7e7ec974"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang artinya \"sakit kepala\"?","options":["headache","cough","elbow","injection"],"answer":0,"exp":"sakit kepala = headache.","k":"809eaf34"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti kata \"dress\" adalah...","options":["gaun","ukuran","kemeja","pelanggan"],"answer":0,"exp":"dress = gaun.","k":"21dbf107"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang artinya \"pesawat\"?","options":["plane","taxi","motorbike","driver"],"answer":0,"exp":"pesawat = plane.","k":"1e747e9e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata mana yang artinya \"merancang\"?","options":["design","restaurant","nurse","serve"],"answer":0,"exp":"merancang = design.","k":"7b89099a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti kata \"badminton\" adalah...","options":["bulu tangkis","pelatih","konser","hobi"],"answer":0,"exp":"badminton = bulu tangkis.","k":"6ddd11e9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"The cat licked ___ paw.\"","options":["its","it's","it","is"],"answer":0,"exp":"Milik kucing.","k":"89320008"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih awalan yang tepat untuk \"tidak setuju\": ___agree","options":["dis","un","im","mis"],"answer":0,"exp":"Dis- = tidak.","k":"17097815"}],"read":[]}